flowchart TD
    A([🖥️ User / Analyst]) --> B[Streamlit Web Interface]

    B --> C{Data Source}
    C -->|Synthetic| D[Synthetic Dataset Generator]
    C -->|Upload| E[CSV File Upload]

    D --> F[Data Validation Layer]
    E --> F

    F --> G{Valid?}
    G -->|❌ Invalid| H[Error Message + Guidance]
    H --> B
    G -->|✅ Valid| I[Data Preprocessing Pipeline]

    I --> J[Feature Extraction\nColumnTransformer]
    J --> K{Has Labels?}

    K -->|✅ Labelled| L[Stratified Train/Test Split\n75% train · 25% test]
    K -->|❌ No Labels| M[Prediction-Only Mode]

    L --> N[Random Forest Training\n150 trees · balanced weights]
    N --> O[Held-Out Test Evaluation]
    O --> P[Metrics: Acc · Prec · Rec · F1\nConfusion Matrix · FP/FN]

    M --> Q[Apply Trained Model]
    O --> Q
    Q --> R[Prediction Results\nLabel · Risk Level · Confidence]

    P --> S[Dashboard Visualisations]
    R --> S

    S --> T[Threat Analysis View]
    S --> U[Model Evaluation View]
    S --> V[Security Insights View]

    T --> W([Analyst Review\n⚠️ Human decision required])
    U --> W
    V --> W

    style A fill:#0f2040,color:#00d4ff,stroke:#00d4ff
    style W fill:#0f2040,color:#00d4ff,stroke:#00d4ff
    style H fill:#3a1020,color:#ff4b6e,stroke:#ff4b6e
    style N fill:#0f2040,color:#00cc6a,stroke:#00cc6a
    style O fill:#0f2040,color:#00d4ff,stroke:#00d4ff

